### ==============================================================================
### Bright Mind Ltd - Smart Task & Project Management System
### Phase 7: Dashboard Summary & Analytics Test Suite (VS Code REST Client / Postman)
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000/api
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Login as User 1 (Alex Morgan - Project Owner with Data)
# @name loginUser1
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@brightmind.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

@tokenUser1 = {{loginUser1.response.body.data.token}}

### 2. Login as User 5 (Tanvir Hasan - Fresh User with Empty State)
# @name loginUser5
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tanvir.hasan@brightmind.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

@tokenUser5 = {{loginUser5.response.body.data.token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### DASHBOARD METRICS TESTS (GET /api/dashboard)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3. Get Dashboard for Populated User (Expect: 200 OK with accurate counts & metrics)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 4. Get Dashboard for Empty-State User (Expect: 200 OK with 0s and empty arrays, no errors)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser5}}

### 5. Access Dashboard Without Token (Expect: 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### DYNAMIC METRIC VERIFICATION: CREATE OVERDUE TASK & OBSERVE CHANGE
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6. Create Overdue Task (due_date in the past)
# @name createOverdueTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": 1,
  "title": "Resolve Security Vulnerability CVE-2026",
  "status": "To Do",
  "priority": "High",
  "due_date": "2026-01-15"
}

@overdueTaskId = {{createOverdueTask.response.body.data.task.id}}

### 7. Re-check Dashboard (overdueTasks and pendingTasks should increase by 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 8. Mark Overdue Task as Completed
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{overdueTaskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed"
}

### 9. Re-check Dashboard (overdueTasks should decrease, completedTasks increase)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 10. Clean up temporary test task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{overdueTaskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}
